        <font face="Arial,Geneva,Helvetica">
<p>&nbsp;
<p>
            <center>
                <font size="+2" color=red>
                    A Mother’s Love
                </font>
            </center>
            <blockquote>
                <p>
                <p>
                There’s a silent scattering of the most sparkling, golden sunshine<br>
                Over my melancholic memory strands in my reflectively sorrowful mind<br>
                This sunshine is warmly secure and lovingly radiant<br>
                It’ s beaming with a rainbow of mercy and so joyfully brilliant<br>
                It’s filled with forgiveness for every failing, fault, and wrong<br>
                This love is extremely tender yet oh so very exceedingly strong!<br>
                Its rays can penetrate through the roughest and severest thunderstorm<br>
                Drying away all kinds of tumultuous tears without any signing of a form<br>
                This love from a mother lives on in our memory and is never forgotten<br>
                A mother loves us forever as Mary loved her Son, dead and begotten!<br>
                <p>
            </blockquote>
